  "key": "SFCC-316",
  "summary": "Zimmermann Benefits - Contentful",
  "description": "As a Site Merchandiser, I want to manage the Zimmermann Benefits content in Contentful, so that the section label, tile icons, and tile copy can be updated per storefront without a code deployment.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers the Contentful content authoring for the Zimmermann Benefits section. This is not a component — it is a set of authored content fields that the PWA Kit renders (see [SFCC-317](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-317) ). The section consists of a section label and 3 tiles. Each tile is built using the Contentful Icon and Text component [SFCC-835](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-835) — containing an icon (media asset) and text (title and optional body copy). Background colour and styling are defined in the Zimmermann design system and are not content-authored.\n\nThe initial tile content based on the Figma designs is: FREE RETURNS, FAST SHIPPING, and SECURE PAYMENTS — however all content is editable in Contentful.\n\nThis story covers the Contentful content type definition for the Zimmermann Benefits. The PWA Kit component consumes this content type to render the section label and benefit tiles dynamically. \n\nThe corresponding PWA Kit render story is [SFCC-317](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-317) \n\n*Designs:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40003224-108794&t=LoK8B0rP9ZfPNhuQ-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\nDesktop:\n\n![\"image-20260817-032946.png\"](image-20260817-032946.png)\n\nMobile:\n\n![\"image-20260828-001137.png\"](image-20260828-001137.png)",
