{"result":"{
  "id": "19340",
  "key": "SFCC-835",
  "summary": "Icon and Text - Contentful Component Model",
  "description": "**As a** Site Merchandiser,\n\n**I want** to manage the Icon and Text component content in Contentful,\n\n**so that** icons, headings, and body copy can be updated per storefront without a code deployment.\n\n----\n\nThis is a Contentful Component Story.\n\nThis story covers the Contentful content type definition for the Icon and Text component. The PWA Kit component consumes this content type to render individual tiles dynamically, each containing an icon, a bold heading, and a body text paragraph.\n\nThe component supports 4, 3, or 2 tiles horizontally, as well as a vertical layout. Content should be fully authored in Contentful with no hardcoded values.\n\nThe corresponding PWA Kit story is [SFCC-317](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-317).\n\n----\n\n*UI Kit:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40003038-130551&t=KPloYCa8NlbXMWeU-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026)  \n\n![\"image-20260827-061526.png\"](image-20260827-061526.png)\n\nExamples of where this component is used;\n\n- Zimmermann Benefits on Cart Page\n\n![\"image-20260827-061615.png\"](image-20260827-061615.png)",
